---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — PDF Utilities"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of PDF Utilities browser-based tools."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <div class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-6">
      <nav class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 mb-2">
        <a href="/" class="hover:underline">
          ← Back to home
        </a>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: October 12, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing and using PDF Utilities, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of
        Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website or tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. Use of Tools</h2>
      <p>
        Our tools (merge, split, compress) are provided free of charge for personal and professional
        use directly within your web browser. You agree to use these tools only for lawful purposes
        and in accordance with all applicable laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. Intellectual Property and File Ownership</h2>
      <p>
        You retain full ownership and copyright of any PDF files you process using our tools.
        Because files are processed entirely client-side, we never claim any rights over your data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        PDF Utilities are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any
        kind, whether express or implied. While we strive for high reliability and accuracy, we do
        not warrant that the tools will be uninterrupted or error-free. Always maintain backups of
        your important documents.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        In no event shall PDF Utilities or its contributors be liable for any indirect, incidental,
        special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or connected with your use of the
        site or tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the site following
        any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-500 space-y-2">
    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-6 text-gray-600">
      <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-indigo-600">
        Privacy Policy
      </a>
      <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-indigo-600">
        Terms of Service
      </a>
    </div>
    <p>
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} PDF Utilities. All rights reserved. 100% Client-Side Processing.
    </p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
